title: Pictures and video
say: Here is a picture from lesson prep, on the board.
image card: test-card.svg
say: It can be marked like any other line.
mark: box card
say: A picture made during the class keeps its place until it is ready.
generate made: a red circle on a white background
say: Now a video, beside the board.
video: test-clip.mp4
show: video | board
say: The class watches it for a few seconds.
play: for 4
say: It can be played from a chosen moment, more quietly, while the lecturer talks over it.
play: at 6
say: This sentence is said while the video plays.
stop:
say: The video alone fills the stage.
show: video
say: A slide can hold a video too, and the class watches that.
slides: test/media
show: slides
play: at 1 for 3
say: And a picture can be put in an area of a slide.
slide: next
image onslide @work: test-card.svg
say: Back to the board. That is the end of the test.
show: board
